{"client_side":"required","server_side":"required","game_versions":["1.20.1","1.20.4","1.20.6","1.21.1","1.21.4","1.21.8","26.1.2"],"environment":["client_and_server"],"id":"kN5LSkbe","slug":"cherry-samurai-temple","project_type":"mod","team":"Htq5uXxW","organization":null,"title":"Cherry Samurai Temple","description":"Adds a Cherry Samurai Temple with samurai enemies, armor, and katanas","body":"## Samurai Temple Mod\n\nAdds a Samurai Temple in Cherry Grove biomes — a multi-layered structure filled with battles, secrets, new loot rewards and a challenging miniboss at the end\n![Temple](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/081bca515ee737a29918d7e83035139791689dff.jpeg)\n## Temple Features\n- Large structure with multiple layers\n- Beautifully decorated in traditional Samurai style\n- Loot and hidden secrets on each level\n- Miniboss fight at the top\n\n## New Mobs\n- Samurai: Attacks on sight with a katana, chance to drop the weapon\n- Steve Samurai: A stronger miniboss version with a special katana\n![Samurai](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de5e85e5218095a3eb7ce43356d575a62670c6a7.jpeg)\n\n## Weapons\n- Katana: Faster than regular swords, repairable with iron ingots\n- Cherry Katana: Stronger version that gives a speed boost when held, repairable with amethyst shards\n  ![Katanas](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/21fc28f7050cca9947651e3e2624e4271ed59fbd.jpeg)\n##   Armor\n- Samurai Armor: Scattered throughout the temple, weaker than iron armor, repairable with iron nuggets\n  ![Samurai Armor](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8d90572d2b7dd0e4452232417da4f2e77c95c0ee.jpeg)\n\n\nYou are free to include this mod in your modpacks\n\nMade by Leonxkingx and MadeBySanny\n\n![Inside](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4d81eaa4f299387285acbf2e999be7cc29329e1.jpeg)\n","body_url":null,"published":"2025-02-24T00:45:19.881831Z","updated":"2026-06-14T23:19:37.040828Z","approved":"2025-02-25T09:21:27.443871Z","queued":"2025-02-24